      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PHOENIX AMELIA (3) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 1.75 lengths from the winner Brownlow (25.76) at this track. Has a strong record from box 3, including two wins. Can go on with it. CAKE IS GREAT (2) was strongly fancied on the back of a win two starts back but finished third last time (19.11) at Q Straight. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Leading player again. HUCKLEBERRY HUGO (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 25.92 beating Padova. Goes well out of this box with a win and seven minor placings. Form should stack up. NON STOP WHISKEY (6) will make his presence felt on the back of recent top-three finishes.",
